  "id": "gta-v-enhanced-steve",
  "title": "Steve in GTA V Enhanced",
  "tagline": "Real Minecraft in GTA V Enhanced: build walls that stop traffic, blow up TNT and fly an elytra.",
  "description": "Play GTA V Enhanced's story as Steve. Blocks you place become solid in Los Santos, so people and cars stop at your walls. TNT and creepers blow up in both games, crossbow fireworks burst as GTA rockets, sword swings send people flying and ender pearls move you. Glide with an elytra, set Minecraft's mobs on the police and walk through a lit Nether portal to turn the streets into the Nether. Switch to Survival and GTA's bullets hurt Steve, unless he holds up his shield. Both games run at the same time and GTA V blends Minecraft into its own picture.",
  "method": "passthrough",
  "tier": "unlocked",
  "testLabel": "beta",
